><given-names>AT</given-names></name><name><surname>Bender</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name><name><surname>Preston</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name></person-group><year>1984</year><article-title>Cytogenetic findings in persons living near the Love Canal</article-title><source>JAMA</source><volume>251</volume><fpage>1437</fpage><lpage>1440</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6700040</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b15-ehp-117-1265"><mixed-citation publication-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hennekens</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Buring</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><year>1987</year><source>Epidemiology in Medicine</source><publisher-loc>Boston</publisher-loc><publisher-name>Little, Brown and Company</publisher-name></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b16-ehp-117-1265"><mixed-citation publication-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hosmer</surname><given-names>DW</given-names></name><name><surname>Lemeshow</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><year>1999</year><source>Applied Survival Analysis: Regression Modeling of Time to Event Data</source><publisher-loc>New York</publisher-loc><publisher-name>John Wiley and Sons</publisher-name></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b17-ehp-117-1265"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><collab>IARC (International Agency for Research on Cancer)</collab><year>1979</year><source>Some Halogenated Hydrocarbons IARC Monogr Eval Carcinog Risk Hum</source><volume>20</volume><fpage>1</fpage><lpage>609</lpage><comment>Available: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://monographs.iarc.fr/ENG/Monographs/vol20/volume20.pdf">http://monographs.iarc.fr/ENG/Monographs/vol20/volume20.pdf</ext-link></comment><date-in-citation>[accessed 17 June 2009]</date-in-citation></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b18-ehp-117-1265"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-gr